      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764271717172,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. Scrape weather data every 1 hour\n2. We should be able to query the scraped weather data\n3. We should be able to generate alerts on the weather \n    data\n\nNon Funcutonal Requirements\n1. The system should be available (CAP)\n2. The system should be fault tolerant\n3. THe system should be scalable",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. Scrape weather data every 1 hour\n2. We should be able to query the scraped weather data\n3. We should be able to generate alerts on the weather \n    data\n\nNon Funcutonal Requirements\n1. The system should be available (CAP)\n2. The system should be fault tolerant\n3. THe system should be scalable",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
